      "content": "but you aren't seeing it from my perspective. it's not about being sad, it's just the reality of the situation. if a person is causing constant harm to the people they love, wouldn't the most compassionate thing to do be to step out of the way? it feels like a math equation, really. less weight, more resources for them. why is that so hard to understand?",
